      "mr": "टेट्रा-अमेलिया सिंड्रोम (हात आणि पाय नसलेल्या) सह जन्मलेले. वयाच्या 10 व्या वर्षी गंभीर गुंडगिरी, एकटेपणा आणि आत्महत्येचा प्रयत्न केला.",
      "ms": "Dilahirkan dengan sindrom tetra-amelia (tanpa tangan dan kaki). Mengalami buli yang teruk, kesepian dan cubaan membunuh diri pada usia 10 tahun.",
      "mt": "Imwieled bis-sindromu tetra-amelia (mingħajr dirgħajn u saqajn). Sofra bullying sever, solitudni, u attentat ta' suwiċidju fl-età ta' 10.",
      "my": "tetra-amelia syndrome (လက်နှင့်ခြေထောက်မပါ) ဖြင့်မွေးဖွားသည်။ ပြင်းထန်စွာ အနိုင်ကျင့်ခံရခြင်း၊ အထီးကျန်ဆန်ပြီး အသက် 10 နှစ်အရွယ်တွင် မိမိကိုယ်ကို သတ်သေရန် ကြိုးပမ်းခဲ့သည်။",
      "ne": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "nl": "Geboren met het tetra-ameliasyndroom (zonder armen en benen). Lijdde op 10-jarige leeftijd aan ernstige pesterijen, eenzaamheid en zelfmoordpogingen.",
      "no": "Født med tetra-amelia syndrom (uten armer og ben). Ble utsatt for alvorlig mobbing, ensomhet og selvmordsforsøk i en alder av 10.",
      "ny": "Wobadwa ndi matenda a tetra-amelia (wopanda manja ndi miyendo). Anazunzidwa koopsa, kusungulumwa, ndipo anayesa kudzipha ali ndi zaka 10.",
      "or": "ଟେଟ୍ରା-ଆମେଲିଆ ସିଣ୍ଡ୍ରୋମ ସହିତ ଜନ୍ମ (ବାହୁ ଏବଂ ଗୋଡ ବିନା) | 10 ବର୍ଷ ବୟସରେ ଅତ୍ୟଧିକ ଗାଳିଗୁଲଜ, ଏକାକୀତା ଏବଂ ଆତ୍ମହତ୍ୟା ଉଦ୍ୟମ କରିଥିଲେ",
      "pa": "ਟੈਟਰਾ-ਐਮੇਲੀਆ ਸਿੰਡਰੋਮ ਨਾਲ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੋਇਆ (ਬਾਹਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਲੱਤਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾਂ)। 10 ਸਾਲ ਦੀ ਉਮਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਗੰਭੀਰ ਧੱਕੇਸ਼ਾਹੀ, ਇਕੱਲਤਾ, ਅਤੇ ਖੁਦਕੁਸ਼ੀ ਦੀ ਕੋਸ਼ਿਸ਼ ਕੀਤੀ।",
      "ps": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "pt": "Nasceu com síndrome de tetra-amélia (sem braços e pernas). Sofreu bullying severo, solidão e tentativa de suicídio aos 10 anos.",
      "rn": "Yavutse afise indwara ya tetra-amelia (ata maboko n’amaguru). Yarashikiwe n’ugutotezwa cane, irungu, agerageza kwiyahura afise imyaka 10.",
      "ro": "Născut cu sindrom tetra-amelia (fără brațe și picioare). A suferit agresiuni severe, singurătate și a încercat să se sinucidă la vârsta de 10 ani.",
      "rw": "Yavutse afite syndrome ya tetra-amelia (idafite amaboko n'amaguru). Yababajwe cyane no gutotezwa, kwigunga, no kugerageza kwiyahura afite imyaka 10.",
      "si": "tetra-amelia syndrome (අත් සහ කකුල් නොමැතිව) සමඟ උපත. වයස අවුරුදු 10 දී දරුණු හිරිහැර කිරීම්, තනිකම, සහ සියදිවි නසා ගැනීමට තැත් කිරීම.",
      "sl": "Rojen s tetra-amelia sindromom (brez rok in nog). Trpel hudo ustrahovanje, osamljenost in poskus samomora pri 10 letih.",
      "sm": "Fanau mai ma le tetra-amelia syndrome (e aunoa ma lima ma vae). Sa mafatia i sauaga ogaoga, tuuatoatasi, ma taumafai e pule i le ola i le 10 o ona tausaga.",
      "sn": "Akazvarwa aine tetra-amelia syndrome (isina maoko nemakumbo). Akashungurudzwa zvakanyanya, kusurukirwa, uye akaedza kuzviuraya aine makore gumi.",
      "so": "Ku dhashay cudurka tetra-amelia syndrome (gacmo la'aan iyo lugo la'aan). Waxa la kulmay cagajugleyn ba'an, kalinimo, iyo isku day is dil isaga oo 10 jir ah.",
      "sq": "Lindur me sindromën tetra-amelia (pa krahë dhe këmbë). Vuajti nga bullizmi i rëndë, vetmia dhe tentoi vetëvrasjen në moshën 10-vjeçare.",
      "sr": "Рођен са синдромом тетра-амелије (без руку и ногу). Претрпео је тешко малтретирање, усамљеност и покушао самоубиство са 10 година.",
      "st": "O tsoetsoe ka lefu la tetra-amelia (le se nang matsoho le maoto). O ile a hlorisoa haholo, a jeoa ke bolutu, 'me a leka ho ipolaea ha a le lilemo li 10.",
      "sv": "Född med tetra-amelia syndrom (utan armar och ben). Utsattes för allvarlig mobbning, ensamhet och självmordsförsök vid 10 års ålder.",
      "sw": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "ta": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "te": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "tg": "Бо синдроми тетра-амелия таваллуд шудааст (бе дасту пой). Дар синни 10-солагӣ аз таҳқири шадид, танҳоӣ ва кӯшиши худкушӣ азоб кашид.",
      "th": "เกิดมาพร้อมกับกลุ่มอาการเตตรา-อมีเลีย (ไม่มีแขนและขา) ถูกกลั่นแกล้งอย่างรุนแรง ความเหงา และพยายามฆ่าตัวตายเมื่ออายุ 10 ขวบ",
      "ti": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "tk": "Tetra-ameliýa sindromy bilen doglan (gol we aýaksyz). Gaty gorkuzma, ýalňyzlyk we 10 ýaşynda öz janyna kast etmek synanyşygy boldy.",
      "tl": "Ipinanganak na may tetra-amelia syndrome (walang mga braso at binti). Nagdusa ng matinding pambu-bully, kalungkutan, at nagtangkang magpakamatay sa edad na 10.",
      "tr": "Tetra-amelia sendromuyla (kolları ve bacakları olmadan) doğdu. 10 yaşındayken şiddetli zorbalığa, yalnızlığa maruz kaldı ve intihara teşebbüs etti.",
      "uk": "Народився з синдромом тетра-амелії (без рук і ніг). Зазнала жорстоких знущань, самотності та спроби самогубства у віці 10 років.",
      "ur": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "uz": "Tetra-amelia sindromi bilan tug'ilgan (qo'llar va oyoqlarsiz). 10 yoshida qattiq zo'ravonlik, yolg'izlik va o'z joniga qasd qilishga uringan.",
      "vi": "Sinh ra đã mắc hội chứng tetra-amelia (không có tay và chân). Bị bắt nạt nghiêm trọng, cô đơn và có ý định tự tử ở tuổi 10.",
      "wo": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
      "xh": "Born with tetra-amelia syndrome (without arms and legs). Suffered severe bullying, loneliness, and attempted suicide at age 10.",
