      "uz": "Hayotda hech narsadan qo'rqmaslik kerak, uni faqat tushunish kerak. Biz kamroq qo'rqishimiz uchun ko'proq tushunish vaqti keldi.",
      "vi": "Không có gì trong cuộc sống đáng sợ, nó chỉ cần được hiểu. Bây giờ là lúc phải hiểu nhiều hơn để chúng ta có thể bớt sợ hãi hơn.",
      "wo": "Nothing in life is to be feared, it is only to be understood. Now is the time to understand more, so that we may fear less.",
      "xh": "Nothing in life is to be feared, it is only to be understood. Now is the time to understand more, so that we may fear less.",
      "yo": "Nothing in life is to be feared, it is only to be understood. Now is the time to understand more, so that we may fear less.",
